context about Energy Works Deal

00:46:53.210 --> 00:46:54.440
Analytics.

00:46:54.440 --> 00:46:58.490
Energy Works Deal Analytics is
used in the pre-deal process

00:46:58.490 --> 00:46:59.890
of a utility.

00:46:59.890 --> 00:47:03.980
And the pre-deal
process is inspecting

00:47:03.980 --> 00:47:06.620
data from industrial
smart meters

00:47:06.620 --> 00:47:10.770
with a resolution varying
from five minutes to an hour.

00:47:10.770 --> 00:47:15.200
And, while inspecting
that data, they

00:47:15.200 --> 00:47:18.890
need to improve often
the data quality.

00:47:18.890 --> 00:47:25.340
So they need to file validation
rules on these data sets coming

00:47:25.340 --> 00:47:26.720
from the smart meters.

00:47:26.720 --> 00:47:28.620
And they have to normalize it.

00:47:28.620 --> 00:47:32.330
And then, if the validation
detects that certain KPI's are

00:47:32.330 --> 00:47:35.150
not met, then we
can automatically

00:47:35.150 --> 00:47:39.500
estimate it and fill
gaps and stuff like that.

00:47:39.500 --> 00:47:41.960
And in the end, we
aggregate all the data,

00:47:41.960 --> 00:47:47.090
and then the final result will
be generating a forecast based

00:47:47.090 --> 00:47:50.000
on the improved quality data.

00:47:50.000 --> 00:47:53.150
And a better forecast
means less risk

00:47:53.150 --> 00:47:58.300
for the utility and a better
proposition to their customer.

00:47:58.300 --> 00:48:00.620
And like Edwin explained,
the commercial offering--

00:48:00.620 --> 00:48:04.400
we brought it back from
several days to minutes.

00:48:04.400 --> 00:48:06.470
And the nice thing,
we completely

00:48:06.470 --> 00:48:10.970
automated this deal analytics
process for the utility

00:48:10.970 --> 00:48:14.390
pre-deal process.

00:48:14.390 --> 00:48:17.540
How this looks like
on a high level view,

00:48:17.540 --> 00:48:20.780
in our Google Cloud
Beacon System,

00:48:20.780 --> 00:48:22.730
is it's completely server-less.

00:48:22.730 --> 00:48:25.610
It's all based on
Pub/Sub and Data Flow

00:48:25.610 --> 00:48:29.970
